base.rea
-3                     spatial dimension  ( < 0 --> generate .rea/.re2 pair)
1                      number of fields
#=======================================================================
# COARSE smoke-test mesh (16 x 10 x 10) for the round particle-laden jet (Modarress et al. 1984): box 20D x 8D x 8D,
# inflow x = 0 (nozzle profile in the UDF), outflow x = 20D, symmetry sides.
# Lengths in nozzle diameters D.
#=======================================================================
Box
-16  -10  -10                                        nelx,nely,nelz
0 20 1.                                              x0,x1,ratio
-4 4 1.                                              y0,y1,ratio
-4 4 1.                                              z0,z1,ratio
v  ,O  ,SYM,SYM,SYM,SYM                              bc's  (3 chars each!)
